WEBVTT

00:05.060 --> 00:06.940
<b><i>Little Runa Sasaki...</i></b>

00:07.860 --> 00:11.740
<b><i>is a young girl who, thanks to her
overprotective mother and gentle father...</i></b>

00:12.150 --> 00:16.200
<b><i>and her older brother, who's always
a step ahead in looking after her...</i></b>

00:16.740 --> 00:19.790
<b><i>was brought up like a princess.</i></b>

00:22.540 --> 00:27.210
<b><i>She loves the chocolate doughnuts from
the venerable neighborhood doughnut shop,</i></b>

00:27.210 --> 00:29.460
<b><i>the online games she excels at...</i></b>

00:29.960 --> 00:33.420
<b><i>and her gamer friends,
who always treat her so kindly.</i></b>

00:36.010 --> 00:40.850
<b><i>As for unfamiliar places,
unfamiliar things, and unfamiliar people,</i></b>

00:45.060 --> 00:46.020
<b><i>she hates them.</i></b>

02:20.030 --> 02:23.490
<b><i>Little Runa Sasaki
was a coddled child growing up,</i></b>

02:23.490 --> 02:27.960
<b><i>and since she tends to believe
that if she keeps quiet and puts on airs,</i></b>

02:23.490 --> 02:30.250
<b>HAUGHTY</b>

02:27.960 --> 02:29.620
<b><i>someone will show her kindness...</i></b>

02:30.250 --> 02:35.630
<b>HAUGHTY</b>

02:31.080 --> 02:34.750
<b><i>her classmates
don't really know what to make of her.</i></b>

02:33.250 --> 02:35.630
<b>YOU KNOW,
THAT GIRL...</b>

02:33.250 --> 02:35.630
<b>SHE'S HARD TO
TALK TO, HUH?</b>

02:36.050 --> 02:39.510
<b><i>Before, the older students
would sometimes bully her,</i></b>

02:37.630 --> 02:40.760
<b>YOU'RE SO CHEEKY</b>

02:37.630 --> 02:40.760
<b>CAN THOSE RIBBONS
BE ANY BIGGER?</b>

02:40.760 --> 02:42.600
<b>I got bullied.</b>

02:41.140 --> 02:46.100
<b><i>But since she has 300 online friends,
it doesn't really bother her.</i></b>

02:41.390 --> 02:41.720
<b>Scary.</b>

02:41.720 --> 02:41.890
<b>Scary.
Let's just be shut-ins.</b>

02:41.890 --> 02:43.180
<b>Scary.
Let's just be shut-ins.
Poor Runa.</b>

02:47.470 --> 02:49.390
<b><i>Even if the girls
who'd been her classmates</i></b>

02:49.390 --> 02:51.150
<b><i>for all three years of middle school...</i></b>

02:51.150 --> 02:53.310
<b>Ms. Sasaki? You're on duty today, right?</b>

02:54.150 --> 02:56.610
<b>Shouldn't you erase the blackboard?</b>

02:56.610 --> 02:58.030
<b>Oh, right.</b>

02:58.400 --> 03:03.530
<b><i>...still call her by her last name,
it doesn't really bother Runa.</i></b>

03:06.290 --> 03:11.210
<b><i>By the way, since little Runa Sasaki has
always been a breathtakingly pretty girl,</i></b>

03:11.710 --> 03:15.090
<b><i>many of the boys
secretly have a crush on her.</i></b>

03:16.380 --> 03:17.590
<b><i>But as her everyday clothes,</i></b>

03:17.590 --> 03:20.010
<b><i>which can sometimes be seen
during school expeditions,</i></b>

03:20.010 --> 03:22.340
<b><i>is of the hardcore gothic Lolita variety</i></b>

03:22.340 --> 03:25.350
<b><i>and because her hair color is slightly
different than the other girls,</i></b>

03:25.180 --> 03:29.020
<b>I DON'T KNOW...
THERE'S SOMETHING
OFF ABOUT HER...</b>

03:25.350 --> 03:27.970
<b><i>she tends to make the boys cringe a bit.</i></b>

03:29.350 --> 03:32.190
<b><i>On top of that,
Runa's older brother is good-looking,</i></b>

03:32.190 --> 03:35.770
<b><i>and his friend, who she's known
since childhood, is a knockout...</i></b>

03:36.270 --> 03:40.030
<b><i>so they're basically the standard
for all guys in her eyes,</i></b>

03:40.030 --> 03:43.110
<b><i>meaning that the boys in her class
look like this to her.</i></b>

03:45.780 --> 03:48.450
<b>Hey, look, you guys!
I recorded a new video!</b>

03:48.830 --> 03:50.450
<b>Hey, that's adorable!</b>

03:50.450 --> 03:52.080
<b>I was dancing with Yukachi!</b>

03:52.080 --> 03:53.620
<b>Hey, you try it, too!</b>

03:53.620 --> 03:56.630
<b>First you go like this, and...</b>

03:58.550 --> 04:00.300
<b>What's up with that?</b>

04:02.720 --> 04:06.470
<b>The girls are doing
this weird dance
in the classroom.</b>

04:04.220 --> 04:04.680
<b>Looks fun!</b>

04:04.680 --> 04:04.890
<b>Looks fun!
Hey, I bet you're watching it alone
because you're socially challenged.</b>

04:04.890 --> 04:06.180
<b>Looks fun!
Hey, I bet you're watching it alone
because you're socially challenged.
Just say, "Can I join you?"
and go play with them.</b>

04:06.180 --> 04:06.850
<b>Looks fun!
Hey, I bet you're watching it alone
because you're socially challenged.
Just say, "Can I join you?"
and go play with them.
These happy characters scare me.</b>

04:11.020 --> 04:12.850
<b>Uh-oh! I'm going to be late!</b>

04:13.100 --> 04:15.270
<b>Acchan, Makolin, see you!</b>

04:15.270 --> 04:16.480
<b>See you, Micchan!</b>

04:16.650 --> 04:17.770
<b>Bye-bye!</b>

04:17.770 --> 04:20.030
<b>Hey, see you, Ms. Sasaki!</b>

04:20.530 --> 04:21.740
<b>Good luck!</b>

04:21.740 --> 04:22.900
<b>You bet!</b>

04:23.950 --> 04:26.160
<b><i>Little Runa Sasaki...</i></b>

04:27.120 --> 04:28.280
<b>Bye-bye.</b>

04:30.370 --> 04:32.620
<b><i>...is a lion at home
and a mouse outside, spoiled,</i></b>

04:32.620 --> 04:37.380
<b>Episode 6:
I Personally Would Prefer
a Love Comedy Ending</b>

04:32.830 --> 04:34.580
<b><i>and extremely cowardly.</i></b>

04:40.250 --> 04:41.210
<b>Coming!</b>

04:42.760 --> 04:44.680
<b><i>Recently, Runa...</i></b>

04:46.510 --> 04:48.180
<b>Runa! Thanks for coming!</b>

04:48.890 --> 04:51.600
<b><i>...made a new friend
who's a slightly older girl.</i></b>

04:52.890 --> 04:55.900
<b>I've got some of that new pudding
from the convenience store for you!</b>

04:52.890 --> 05:00.270
<b>WANTS TO PLAY</b>

04:56.350 --> 04:59.730
<b><i>Since Akane is slightly more grown-up
than the girls in her class...</i></b>

05:00.610 --> 05:01.440
<b>Akane!</b>

05:02.230 --> 05:04.400
<b>I saw this weird dance at school today!</b>

05:04.400 --> 05:06.160
<b>What? Show me what it's like!</b>

05:06.530 --> 05:10.450
<b><i>...she's nice to Runa even when she's mean
or acts like a spoiled child.</i></b>

05:11.080 --> 05:16.580
<b><i>That's why Runa is somewhat aware
that they're not friends on equal footing.</i></b>

05:11.410 --> 05:15.160
<b>LIKE THIS</b>

05:12.790 --> 05:15.160
<b>LIKE AN EEL</b>

05:17.920 --> 05:19.380
<b>And you know what else?</b>

05:20.750 --> 05:21.840
<b>Hey, hold up a sec.</b>

05:22.170 --> 05:23.710
<b>I got a text from a friend.</b>

05:23.710 --> 05:25.340
<b>HMMM
LET'S SEE</b>

05:24.300 --> 05:28.090
<b><i>But since Akane is neither family
nor a childhood friend,</i></b>

05:28.090 --> 05:30.890
<b><i>it's not like she'll act
the way Runa wants.</i></b>

05:32.140 --> 05:33.680
<b><i>Another friend...</i></b>

05:34.180 --> 05:37.100
<b><i>You can text her later, you know.
You're with me now!</i></b>

05:37.390 --> 05:41.270
<b><i>And it's not like she'll take the time
to comfort her when she's sulking.</i></b>

05:41.820 --> 05:43.780
<b><i>Actually, she doesn't
even notice her sulking.</i></b>

05:44.360 --> 05:46.150
<b>Hey, Runa! Check this out!</b>

05:45.400 --> 05:46.150
<b>HAUGHTY</b>

05:46.150 --> 05:48.360
<b>They're shooting a TV show
in front of the station,</b>

05:48.360 --> 05:49.990
<b>and that actor Satoh is there!</b>

05:49.990 --> 05:50.910
<b>Want to take a look?</b>

05:52.120 --> 05:54.410
<b>You're such a fangirl, you know that?</b>

05:54.410 --> 05:58.170
<b>YOU LOVE CELEBRITIES</b>

05:54.580 --> 05:56.460
<b>Right! I sure am!</b>

05:56.160 --> 05:58.170
<b>YOU LOVE NEW PRODUCTS</b>

05:57.330 --> 05:58.170
<b><i>But...</i></b>

05:58.250 --> 06:00.040
<b>Hey, hurry up!</b>

06:00.040 --> 06:01.380
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

06:01.380 --> 06:04.170
<b><i>...it's different than when she's
with her brother and friends.</i></b>

06:03.210 --> 06:04.170
<b>FAST</b>

06:04.300 --> 06:06.010
<b><i>There's a new kind of excitement.</i></b>

06:07.260 --> 06:11.600
<b><i>Even though she supposedly doesn't like
unfamiliar things or unfamiliar people.</i></b>

06:14.430 --> 06:16.180
<b>Ah...</b>

06:16.640 --> 06:20.350
<b>Even from afar, Satoh was so hot!</b>

06:20.350 --> 06:21.900
<b>Really?</b>

06:22.610 --> 06:24.730
<b>Yamada is better-looking.</b>

06:24.730 --> 06:27.700
<b>Sure he is, but Yamada's Yamada, you know?</b>

06:28.400 --> 06:29.740
<b>True.</b>

06:29.740 --> 06:31.950
<b>Hey! Would you look at that? Over there!</b>

06:31.950 --> 06:33.280
<b>They're dancing!</b>

06:33.280 --> 06:34.580
<b>Looks fun!</b>

06:36.040 --> 06:38.830
<b>Runa doesn't understand why anyone
would dance in the street.</b>

06:39.790 --> 06:43.500
<b>Why don't we jump in
with that weird dance?</b>

06:43.500 --> 06:44.340
<b>Not on your life!</b>

06:44.840 --> 06:45.750
<b>Was it like this?</b>

06:46.460 --> 06:47.550
<b>No, like this!</b>

06:49.180 --> 06:50.630
<b><i>But lately...</i></b>

06:52.140 --> 06:55.260
<b><i>she's starting to think
that if she had more friends</i></b>

06:55.260 --> 06:57.430
<b><i>who'd do this weird dance with her...</i></b>

06:57.930 --> 06:59.940
<b><i>it might be fun. Just a little!</i></b>

07:05.480 --> 07:07.280
<b>I'd like to fall in love.</b>

07:09.860 --> 07:11.990
<b>According to my life plan...</b>

07:12.620 --> 07:16.370
<b>I should be getting married
as soon as I graduate college.</b>

07:16.740 --> 07:19.540
<b>My mom had me when she was 20,</b>

07:19.540 --> 07:23.750
<b>so I've always wanted to get married
as young as possible.</b>

07:24.420 --> 07:27.630
<b>But first I'd need a husband, right?</b>

07:28.130 --> 07:31.760
<b>And to get a husband,
I need a boyfriend first, don't I?</b>

07:33.390 --> 07:35.970
<b>That's why I want to fall in love—</b>

07:35.970 --> 07:39.100
<b>Hey, wait, let the damage dealer finish it off.</b>

07:39.100 --> 07:40.600
<b>Right, you're almost there.</b>

07:40.810 --> 07:43.230
<b>I did it! Quest cleared!</b>

07:43.230 --> 07:47.360
<b>TONKOTSU</b>

07:43.600 --> 07:46.320
<b>No one heard a word I just said,
am I right?</b>

07:46.320 --> 07:47.360
<b>Huh? Oh, sorry!</b>

07:47.570 --> 07:51.360
<b>Listen, Momo,
I've gone up to Level 50 in just a week!</b>

07:51.360 --> 07:52.200
<b>Not interested!</b>

07:52.700 --> 07:54.240
<b>If you do as Runa says,</b>

07:54.240 --> 07:57.410
<b>you can max out your stats
by the end of the month.</b>

07:57.410 --> 08:00.540
<b>Akane, we're free this afternoon.</b>

08:00.540 --> 08:03.170
<b>Are you sure you should be
spending all day on an online game</b>

08:03.170 --> 08:04.580
<b>with a runaway middle-school kid?</b>

08:04.580 --> 08:06.210
<b>She's not a runaway!</b>

08:06.210 --> 08:08.530
<b>But, hey, she and her brother
aren't speaking right now,</b>

08:08.530 --> 08:10.260
<b>so it's awkward for her at home, you know?</b>

08:10.260 --> 08:15.050
<b>Even still, what does it say about us,
playing online games with a child?</b>

08:14.890 --> 08:20.020
<b>I'M NOT A CHILD</b>

08:15.050 --> 08:17.930
<b>If this is boring for you,
why don't you go home?</b>

08:17.930 --> 08:20.020
<b>You did come here for no reason.</b>

08:20.310 --> 08:21.140
<b>You shut up.</b>

08:22.520 --> 08:24.140
<b>Don't mess with me, little girl.</b>

08:26.560 --> 08:30.990
<b>You don't know how lucky you are, Akane,
meeting a handsome young guy.</b>

08:30.990 --> 08:32.530
<b>You mean Yamada?</b>

08:32.530 --> 08:34.280
<b>Hey, it's not what you think.</b>

08:34.780 --> 08:37.070
<b>Well, but we did
get a little closer lately,</b>

08:37.070 --> 08:38.660
<b>and he let me add him as a friend.</b>

08:38.660 --> 08:41.160
<b>Friend request?
Sure.</b>

08:39.410 --> 08:44.000
<b>He's as surly as ever, and he
still won't go hunting with me.</b>

08:43.910 --> 08:48.540
<b>ALWAYS TURNING ME DOWN
WHEN I ASK HIM</b>

08:44.370 --> 08:46.540
<b>That's because your levels
are too far apart,</b>

08:46.540 --> 08:48.540
<b>so it wouldn't be profitable for Yamada.</b>

08:48.880 --> 08:52.550
<b>But if I ask him about equipment,
he gives me all kinds of advice.</b>

08:52.550 --> 08:54.510
<b>He's surprisingly helpful, you know!</b>

08:55.010 --> 08:59.140
<b>Surprisingly?
Yamada's never been anything but helpful.</b>

08:59.640 --> 09:03.560
<b>Even though he's studying for his own
entrance exams, he still tutors me, too.</b>

09:03.560 --> 09:08.310
<b>HEY, I LEVELED UP AGAIN</b>

09:03.810 --> 09:05.940
<b>What? Then he must be beyond popular!</b>

09:06.440 --> 09:08.310
<b>He was beyond popular.</b>

09:08.520 --> 09:09.980
<b>But maybe he's awkward with girls,</b>

09:09.980 --> 09:12.030
<b>since I've never
seen him with a girlfriend.</b>

09:12.030 --> 09:14.070
<b>What? That's such a waste!</b>

09:14.070 --> 09:15.990
<b>Maybe I'll volunteer for the job!</b>

09:15.990 --> 09:16.820
<b>Hey...</b>

09:16.820 --> 09:19.530
<b>SYSTEM: YAMADA IS ONLINE.</b>

09:17.450 --> 09:18.990
<b>Speak of the devil.</b>

09:19.780 --> 09:22.290
<b>Hey! Yamada!</b>

09:27.420 --> 09:28.380
<b>Hey.</b>

09:28.380 --> 09:31.050
<b>It's been a while
since I've seen you online!</b>

09:31.750 --> 09:34.550
<b>I guess. I've been busy lately.</b>

09:34.550 --> 09:35.550
<b>Hey, listen!</b>

09:35.550 --> 09:39.680
<b>I upgraded my shoes
like you taught me the other day!</b>

09:40.850 --> 09:41.890
<b>Yup!</b>

09:41.890 --> 09:43.890
<b>Yamada > Isn't that
the wrong type of upgrade material?</b>

09:44.100 --> 09:47.650
<b>What? But I'm supposed
to use Int gems, right?</b>

09:47.650 --> 09:57.400
<b>INT: MAGIC POWER-UP</b>

09:47.810 --> 09:50.400
<b>I just copied what you did.</b>

09:50.400 --> 09:52.940
<b>I'm a Wizard,
so I use Ints,</b>

09:52.940 --> 09:54.740
<b>but a Paladin
would use Vits first.</b>

09:54.740 --> 09:57.400
<b>Huh? I can't use
these gems, then?</b>

09:54.780 --> 09:57.400
<b>VIT: VITALITY POWER-UP</b>

09:57.400 --> 10:04.790
<b>ONLY A SINGLE GEM
FOR 999 SHARDS...</b>

09:58.660 --> 10:00.990
<b>But I worked so hard to collect them.</b>

10:00.990 --> 10:02.870
<b>Do you want to use
my spare pair of shoes?</b>

10:03.200 --> 10:06.000
<b>They're meant for tanking, and I've
already fully upgraded them.</b>

10:07.290 --> 10:08.750
<b>Hmm...</b>

10:12.210 --> 10:13.840
<b>No. It's all right.</b>

10:14.340 --> 10:16.510
<b>I have to collect
those things called Vits, right?</b>

10:17.420 --> 10:19.890
<b>I'm going hunting again to collect them!</b>

10:20.140 --> 10:22.510
<b>It's not like I don't know
where they're going to drop!</b>

10:22.510 --> 10:27.020
<b>Akane > I already remembered
the location where they drop,
so I'm going to go hunt again
and collect them.</b>

10:27.310 --> 10:28.480
<b>You're right.</b>

10:29.060 --> 10:31.520
<b>Sorry. I was out of line.</b>

10:32.730 --> 10:34.650
<b>Good luck upgrading.</b>

10:37.740 --> 10:39.320
<b>A smiley face?</b>

10:39.660 --> 10:40.910
<b>That never happens!</b>

10:41.320 --> 10:42.660
<b>You're screaming to yourself.</b>

10:42.660 --> 10:44.450
<b>Did you finally break down?</b>

10:44.450 --> 10:45.830
<b><i>Sounds fun.</i></b>

10:48.620 --> 10:50.540
<b>I'm so bored!</b>

10:50.540 --> 10:53.420
<b>All you did is play that game!
I want to go outside!</b>

10:53.420 --> 10:55.380
<b>I want to go on a group date!</b>

11:00.180 --> 11:02.010
<b>Want to give it a try, Momo?</b>

11:02.010 --> 11:03.680
<b>It's actually pretty fun.</b>

11:03.680 --> 11:05.760
<b>Games are beyond Momo!</b>

11:05.760 --> 11:07.770
<b>Come on, just try!</b>

11:07.770 --> 11:10.770
<b>But I'm clueless about computers!</b>

11:10.770 --> 11:13.270
<b>Once you get the hang of it,
they're easy to operate.</b>

11:13.270 --> 11:14.570
<b>Huh?</b>

11:15.070 --> 11:17.820
<b>Okay, I'm going on a hunt now,
so just watch me.</b>

11:28.290 --> 11:31.170
<b>Momo doesn't know much about computers,</b>

11:31.170 --> 11:33.540
<b>but it's a bad sign
if there's smoke coming out, right?</b>

11:37.050 --> 11:39.300
<b>Akanecchi's computer broke down?</b>

11:40.170 --> 11:43.550
<b>Yeah. It exploded
while she was playing FOS.</b>

11:43.720 --> 11:47.220
<b>EXPLODED?</b>

11:44.050 --> 11:47.220
<b>I hear the last update
really bogged down FOS.</b>

11:48.180 --> 11:50.140
<b>Maybe it was too much of a strain.</b>

11:51.690 --> 11:55.110
<b>She says she can't play again
until she saves up enough for a new one.</b>

11:55.110 --> 11:58.110
<b>SPEAKING WITHOUT
MAKING EYE CONTACT
DUE TO ONGOING TENSION</b>

11:55.440 --> 11:56.940
<b>She was really depressed.</b>

11:58.150 --> 12:00.360
<b>HMMM...</b>

11:58.360 --> 11:59.240
<b>Hmm.</b>

12:08.200 --> 12:09.410
<b>Coming!</b>

12:10.790 --> 12:11.870
<b>Who is it—</b>

12:19.710 --> 12:20.670
<b>Hey.</b>

12:23.510 --> 12:25.800
<b>I brought over a repairman.</b>

12:26.510 --> 12:27.350
<b>See?</b>

12:46.030 --> 12:48.530
<b>EITA SASAKI</b>

12:53.540 --> 12:57.040
<b>IGNORING</b>

13:02.550 --> 13:06.430
<b>EITA SASAKI</b>

13:13.140 --> 13:13.980
<b>Yes?</b>

13:13.980 --> 13:15.810
<b><i>Morning, Yamada!</i></b>

13:17.650 --> 13:18.520
<b>Hey.</b>

13:20.650 --> 13:22.110
<b>What's going on?</b>

13:22.110 --> 13:26.070
<b><i>You don't have a used computer, do you?
Like an old spare?</i></b>

13:26.780 --> 13:28.200
<b>No, I don't.</b>

13:28.200 --> 13:31.450
<b><i>I hear that Akanecchi's computer
broke down.</i></b>

13:32.200 --> 13:33.410
<b>Huh.</b>

13:33.410 --> 13:35.410
<b><i>That it was smoking and everything.</i></b>

13:37.040 --> 13:40.000
<b>Smoke? From where?</b>

13:40.000 --> 13:42.130
<b><i>I haven't seen it, so I don't know!</i></b>

13:43.920 --> 13:47.550
<b><i>Could you take a look at Akanecchi's
computer when you have time?</i></b>

13:48.340 --> 13:49.430
<b>Me?</b>

13:49.430 --> 13:52.350
<b><i>You might be able to fix it
by just swapping out a part.</i></b>

13:52.890 --> 13:55.270
<b>Wouldn't it be better if you went, Eita?</b>

13:55.480 --> 13:59.690
<b><i>I wouldn't mind going,
but what if there was a misunderstanding?</i></b>

13:55.480 --> 13:59.690
<b>FRIENDS...</b>

14:00.190 --> 14:03.980
<b><i>You know, a healthy guy going
into a sweet college girl's apartment?</i></b>

14:03.980 --> 14:05.570
<b><i>That would be risky.</i></b>

14:05.570 --> 14:08.030
<b>What exactly do you think I am?</b>

14:08.030 --> 14:08.910
<b><i>A new breed.</i></b>

14:11.120 --> 14:13.830
<b><i>Runa said she was
really depressed about it.</i></b>

14:14.370 --> 14:18.120
<b><i>Akanecchi's been grinding really hard
in FOS lately, so I feel bad for her.</i></b>

14:19.080 --> 14:21.630
<b><i>Stop by after Runa's tutoring session,
will you?</i></b>

14:23.300 --> 14:26.670
<b><i>I'll have Runa take you over
to her apartment, okay?</i></b>

14:26.670 --> 14:27.510
<b><i>Please?</i></b>

14:31.510 --> 14:33.810
<b><i>No. It's all right.</i></b>

14:33.810 --> 14:36.680
<b><i>I just have to collect those things
called Vits, right?</i></b>

14:36.680 --> 14:38.890
<b><i>I'm going hunting again to collect them!</i></b>

14:48.570 --> 14:50.910
<b>You came to fix my computer, Yamada?</b>

14:52.910 --> 14:59.420
<b>GOD...</b>

14:53.080 --> 14:55.200
<b>That's right! I brought him over!</b>

14:55.200 --> 14:58.540
<b>I'm only here to take a look.
Try not to get your hopes up.</b>

14:58.540 --> 14:59.370
<b>I brought him!</b>

14:59.460 --> 15:04.420
<b>JESUS...</b>

14:59.580 --> 15:03.790
<b>Please don't look at me like that.
Seriously, I don't know if I can fix it.</b>

15:03.790 --> 15:04.420
<b>It was me!</b>

15:04.420 --> 15:07.420
<b>OUT OF ORDER</b>

15:05.800 --> 15:06.920
<b>So it's a laptop?</b>

15:07.720 --> 15:09.220
<b>Hey, make yourselves at home!</b>

15:09.720 --> 15:11.510
<b>Do you two want some snacks?</b>

15:11.510 --> 15:13.050
<b>- Please don't trouble—
- I'll have some!</b>

15:14.010 --> 15:15.850
<b><i>Yamada's a good guy!</i></b>

15:16.640 --> 15:18.310
<b>Akane? Akane?</b>

15:19.850 --> 15:22.150
<b>Listen, over there in that room...</b>

15:23.110 --> 15:23.940
<b>Are you sure...</b>

15:24.770 --> 15:25.940
<b>it's okay?</b>

15:33.120 --> 15:34.240
<b><i>Thank goodness.</i></b>

15:34.240 --> 15:35.080
<b><i>He didn't notice.</i></b>

15:34.740 --> 15:38.200
<b>THANKS, RUNA</b>

15:35.580 --> 15:37.700
<b><i>Well, it's Yamada,
so he wouldn't care anyway.</i></b>

15:38.870 --> 15:42.250
<b><i>It feels a little strange,
having Yamada in the house,</i></b>

15:42.250 --> 15:43.710
<b><i>but remember what Runa said...</i></b>

15:43.920 --> 15:45.090
<b><i>...awkward with girls.</i></b>

15:46.300 --> 15:49.590
<b><i>I shouldn't be too self-conscious
around him, or he'll get uncomfortable.</i></b>

15:50.760 --> 15:51.720
<b><i>Just act natural!</i></b>

15:52.430 --> 15:54.470
<b>Hey, have you two had lunch yet?</b>

15:55.430 --> 15:57.810
<b>I'll whip something up if you haven't!</b>

15:57.930 --> 15:59.020
<b>I can eat!</b>

15:59.600 --> 16:01.140
<b>How about you, Yamada?</b>

16:04.020 --> 16:05.900
<b>Yes. I'll have some.</b>

16:06.400 --> 16:08.190
<b><i>Well, well! How rare!</i></b>

16:08.190 --> 16:10.190
<b>WHAT I
EXPECTED</b>

16:08.190 --> 16:10.190
<b>I'M NOT
HUNGRY</b>

16:09.070 --> 16:10.190
<b>No, thanks.</b>

16:11.280 --> 16:13.070
<b>I forgot to tell you this before.</b>

16:15.740 --> 16:19.450
<b>That curry you gave me,
it was really good.</b>

16:19.950 --> 16:24.080
<b>Sorry. I just remembered now,
so I forgot to bring the containers back</b>

16:26.590 --> 16:27.710
<b>I'm so happy!</b>

16:29.090 --> 16:32.090
<b>CURRY?</b>

16:29.210 --> 16:32.090
<b>I'm going to pour my heart and soul
into lunch, so have lots, okay?</b>

16:36.930 --> 16:40.600
<b>Listen, a new girl just joined our guild.</b>

16:40.810 --> 16:41.810
<b>What?</b>

16:41.810 --> 16:44.520
<b>She's a really sweet-natured girl
and cute.</b>

16:45.020 --> 16:58.370
<b>RURIHIME</b>

16:45.190 --> 16:46.900
<b><i>Rurihime!</i></b>

16:46.480 --> 16:58.370
<b>A STRANGER YELLED
AT ME IN THE
DUNGEON AGAIN...</b>

16:46.900 --> 16:49.900
<b><i>A stranger yelled at me
in the dungeon again!</i></b>

16:49.860 --> 16:58.370
<b>I'M AGAINST
BULLYING
NEWBIES!</b>

16:50.280 --> 16:52.150
<b><i>I'm against
bullying newbies!</i></b>

16:52.360 --> 16:55.240
<b>She totally wears
her heart on her sleeve.</b>

16:55.240 --> 16:58.370
<b>Or should I say she doesn't
really hide who she is?</b>

17:00.080 --> 17:04.080
<b>I think a straightforward girl like her
would be a good match for you, Akito.</b>

17:04.920 --> 17:06.960
<b>Runa refuses to accept a stranger like that!</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:08.960
<b>What are you, his sister-in-law?</b>

17:18.350 --> 17:19.680
<b><i>I'm not interested.</i></b>

17:21.600 --> 17:23.770
<b>The adapter pin's all melted.</b>

17:23.770 --> 17:25.020
<b>ADAPTER?</b>

17:26.230 --> 17:28.230
<b>When did you buy this laptop?</b>

17:28.230 --> 17:31.530
<b>Back when I started college, so, um...</b>

17:31.690 --> 17:35.150
<b>YOU HAVE A MESSAGE FROM RUNA</b>

17:37.030 --> 17:38.780
<b>They look cute together</b>

17:38.780 --> 17:41.790
<b>ENJOY ENERGY</b>

17:41.990 --> 17:43.040
<b>Kyururu!</b>

17:44.540 --> 17:47.920
<b>They're starting to have a moment,
but there's still some distance</b>

17:46.040 --> 17:47.920
<b>Do what you can
to help then grow closer</b>

17:50.670 --> 17:55.170
<b>Help?</b>

17:52.670 --> 17:55.170
<b>I personally would prefer
a love comedy ending</b>

17:55.800 --> 17:58.930
<b><i>Love comedy? I think...</i></b>

17:59.930 --> 18:04.430
<b>RUNNING INTO
 EACH OTHER
IN THE BATH</b>

18:00.180 --> 18:04.430
<b>OH, NO!</b>

18:00.430 --> 18:04.430
<b>LUCKY PERV</b>

18:00.430 --> 18:04.430
<b>OH, NO!</b>

18:00.930 --> 18:04.430
<b>RUNNING LATE
WITH BREAD
IN MY MOUTH</b>

18:00.930 --> 18:04.430
<b>OH, NO!</b>

18:02.850 --> 18:03.850
<b><i>Like this?</i></b>

18:07.190 --> 18:09.360
<b>You've never cleaned
your keyboard once, have you?</b>

18:10.060 --> 18:11.360
<b>What, you're supposed to?</b>

18:11.360 --> 18:12.900
<b>There are traces of a spill.</b>

18:12.900 --> 18:14.650
<b>Stop! Don't look!</b>

18:25.450 --> 18:28.540
<b>It's another lovely day!</b>

18:36.550 --> 18:37.550
<b>Akane?</b>

18:39.470 --> 18:41.600
<b>What's up? It's almost ready.</b>

18:41.600 --> 18:42.430
<b>Listen...</b>

18:43.470 --> 18:45.720
<b>RUNNING INTO
 EACH OTHER
IN THE BATH</b>

18:43.560 --> 18:45.720
<b>OH, NO!</b>

18:43.560 --> 18:46.180
<b>Will you be taking a bath right now?</b>

18:46.180 --> 18:47.730
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

18:48.520 --> 18:51.270
<b>I'm cooking right now,
so I'll be taking a bath at night.</b>

18:56.360 --> 18:58.450
<b>Yamada, are you going to take a bath?</b>

18:58.450 --> 18:59.570
<b>No, I'm not.</b>

19:00.070 --> 19:01.320
<b>Huh?</b>

19:01.870 --> 19:04.080
<b>I don't really get it, so whatever.</b>

19:04.830 --> 19:07.080
<b>Akane! Can I have a slice of bread?</b>

19:07.410 --> 19:08.330
<b>Be my guest!</b>

19:10.040 --> 19:12.670
<b>Won't you get full, eating all that?</b>

19:12.670 --> 19:14.420
<b>I'm making omurice now.</b>

19:14.670 --> 19:16.960
<b>Don't worry.
I'm not the one who'll be eating it.</b>

19:16.960 --> 19:17.800
<b>Huh?</b>

19:18.720 --> 19:25.310
<b>BAFFLED BY THE SUDDEN
TURN OF EVENTS</b>

19:20.180 --> 19:25.310
<b>SHE MADE HER EAT IT,
BUT IS EATING TOAST
WHILE RUNNING LATE
REALLY A LOVE COMEDY?
BAFFLED BY NOT KNOWING
IF IT'S A LOVE COMEDY</b>

19:28.600 --> 19:30.270
<b>Why did you eat it all?</b>

19:30.270 --> 19:31.810
<b>Why did you make me eat it?</b>

19:31.810 --> 19:33.520
<b>Hey, come over here!</b>

19:33.520 --> 19:34.570
<b>Hold up! Hold up!</b>

19:34.570 --> 19:35.900
<b>- Get a little closer...
- Come on.</b>

19:35.900 --> 19:38.240
<b>- ...or no lucky perv moment!
- It's dangerous! Stop pushing!</b>

19:38.240 --> 19:40.240
<b>What do you mean?</b>

19:46.330 --> 19:48.830
<b><i>Huh? Now what am I supposed to do?</i></b>

19:48.830 --> 19:49.660
<b>Hey...</b>

19:49.960 --> 19:51.420
<b>you need to stop right now!</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:53.420
<b>Ouch...</b>

19:53.670 --> 19:55.090
<b>Yamada? What's wrong?</b>

19:55.590 --> 19:57.550
<b>Your hair hit my eyeball.</b>

19:57.550 --> 19:59.170
<b>No way! Sorry!</b>

19:59.170 --> 20:00.930
<b>Are you okay? It got in your eye?</b>

20:01.430 --> 20:02.760
<b>Ouch.</b>

20:03.590 --> 20:04.510
<b>Let me see it.</b>

20:07.310 --> 20:08.270
<b>Which eye?</b>

20:19.240 --> 20:21.820
<b>I'm fine.</b>

20:26.200 --> 20:27.740
<b><i>Huh? Oh, crap!</i></b>

20:27.740 --> 20:29.870
<b><i>I panicked and grabbed his hair
without thinking!</i></b>

20:29.870 --> 20:31.830
<b><i>Did he really hate that, I wonder?</i></b>

20:32.250 --> 20:34.330
<b>I'm sorry, Yamada!</b>

20:34.330 --> 20:36.250
<b>You apologize, too, Runa!</b>

20:36.250 --> 20:38.550
<b>I'm... sorry.</b>

20:40.130 --> 20:42.170
<b>I'll tie my hair up, okay?</b>

20:42.170 --> 20:43.470
<b>- Um...
- Yes?</b>

20:44.090 --> 20:46.550
<b>I'm heading back home for now.</b>

20:46.550 --> 20:47.680
<b>What?</b>

20:47.680 --> 20:50.560
<b>Because I didn't bring over
any of the tools I need.</b>

20:51.270 --> 20:52.230
<b>Oh, but—</b>

20:52.230 --> 20:53.640
<b>I'll be right back.</b>

20:53.640 --> 20:55.350
<b>Isn't it a hassle going back and forth?</b>

20:55.350 --> 20:57.610
<b>- I really feel bad now.
- It's all right.</b>

20:57.610 --> 20:58.820
<b>I live nearby.</b>

21:08.990 --> 21:11.410
<b>It was like he was escaping.</b>

21:12.160 --> 21:13.910
<b>So you think so, too?</b>

21:16.040 --> 21:18.340
<b><i>He really must have been uncomfortable.</i></b>

21:18.920 --> 21:22.050
<b><i>So it's true that he's awkward with women.</i></b>

21:23.550 --> 21:25.760
<b><i>I wish I hadn't done that to him.</i></b>

23:01.520 --> 23:04.480
<b><i>Girls who have less hair...</i></b>

23:05.230 --> 23:06.990
<b>AKANE</b>

23:05.530 --> 23:06.990
<b><i>can use this kind of pin...</i></b>

23:08.490 --> 23:10.990
<b>TYPE: THIN</b>

23:08.990 --> 23:10.450
<b><i>to tie their hair back simply.</i></b>

23:08.990 --> 23:10.990
<b>AMOUNT: NOT TOO MUCH</b>

23:11.490 --> 23:14.240
<b><i>Girls who have lots of hair...</i></b>

23:14.240 --> 23:14.990
<b>RUNA</b>

23:17.500 --> 23:19.870
<b>AMOUNT: A LOT</b>

23:17.750 --> 23:19.870
<b>TYPE: THICK</b>

23:18.460 --> 23:19.420
<b><i>turn out like this.</i></b>

23:19.870 --> 23:25.250
<b>MY ARMS ARE TIRED</b>

23:20.460 --> 23:24.000
<b><i>Girls who have lots of hair
have a hard time with ponytails.</i></b>

23:22.250 --> 23:25.260
<b>I CAN'T DO THIS ANYMORE</b>

23:25.960 --> 23:28.590
<b>You don't have a lot of hair, Akane.
That makes me jealous.</b>

23:29.090 --> 23:30.930
<b>Isn't it better to have more hair?</b>

23:30.930 --> 23:32.510
<b>No, not really.</b>

23:34.390 --> 23:36.810
<b><i>There's no end
to a young girl's anxieties.</i></b>

23:37.810 --> 23:39.520
<b>Ah.</b>
